   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Golden glow: median ~76, warm brown shadows (48,37,30), very warm highlights (238,200,140), red+orange 59% of colour mass, saturation 0.39, foliage vivid (0.59), little blue sky. Best for: Sunset and sunrise frames, backlit forests, golden-hour couples in fields, desert and dune scenes, warm autumn. Not for midday blue-sky frames (it warms everything).</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
